  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&#x2019;s Go Out &#x2013; Let&#x2019;s Work Together Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Serbia):  This activity will look to advance equity and economic opportunity for lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer, and intersex (LGBTQI+) people, by promoting economic inclusion, advancement, and related empowerment of LGBTQI+ people in the Serbian marketplace. The activity will develop workplace programs directly with businesses to address internal systems that potentially inhibit hiring, retention and promotion of LGBTQI+ employees and provide training and capacity-building for hiring professionals, managers and staff on diversity fundamentals, bias, and principles of inclusion that contribute to a respectful, safe, and inclusive work environment and enhances retention. This activity will have significant interaction with the private sector and supports the USG&apos;s priorities to promote equity and inclusion and to grow economic opportunities and prosperity. It supports ICS Mission Objective 2.1 &quot;Broad-Based, Inclusive, and Sustainable Economic Growth Accelerated, Including Through Improved Access to U.S. and European Finance and an Improved Ecosystem for the Knowledge-Based Economy.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
